Domain Entity Intervention
    documentation 'An implementation of an instructional approach focusing on the specific 
                  'techniques and materials used to teach a given subject.
    include EducationContentSource
        documentation 'Resources related to or used in this intervention, including any documentation 
                      'around the Intervention itself. Since an intervention is intended to be a 
                      'published intervention, an intervention should have at least one such resource.
        is required
    enumeration InterventionClass
        documentation 'The way in which an intervention is used: curriculum, supplement, or practice.
        is required
    descriptor Diagnosis
        documentation 'Targeted purpose of the Intervention (e.g., attendance issue, dropout risk).
        is optional collection
    enumeration PopulationServed
        documentation 'A subset of students that are the focus of the Intervention. 
        is optional collection
    enumeration Sex
        documentation 'Sexes for the Intervention. If omitted, considered generally applicable.
        is optional collection
        with context Appropriate
    descriptor GradeLevel
        documentation 'Grade levels for the Intervention-if omitted, considered generally applicable.
        is optional collection
        with context Appropriate
    enumeration DeliveryMethod
        documentation 'The way in which an intervention was implemented: individual, small group, whole 
                      'class, or whole school.
        is required
    reference InterventionPrescription
        documentation 'The reference to the intervention prescription being followed in this intervention 
                      'implementation.
        is optional collection
        with context InterventionPrescription
    date BeginDate
        documentation 'The start date for the intervention implementation.
        is required
    date EndDate
        documentation 'The end date for the intervention implementation.
        is optional
    include MeetingTime
        documentation 'The times at which this intervention is scheduled to meet.
        is optional collection
    reference Staff
        documentation 'Relates the staff member associated with the Intervention.
        is optional collection
    reference EducationOrganization
        documentation 'Relates the Education Organization which is sponsoring the intervention 
                      'implementation.
        is part of identity
    shared string IdentificationCode named IdentificationCode
        documentation 'A unique number or alphanumeric code assigned to an intervention.
        is part of identity
        with context Intervention
